Package: statgit
Type: Package
Title: Version Control and Project Management for Statistics in RStudio
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Geovani Ariel Bueno",
      family = "Paschoini",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "geovaniariel08@hotmail.com"
    )
  )
Description: For interactive use in RStudio, provides addins and a 'Shiny'
    interface that help Statistics students work with Git-based version
    control, create projects from templates, and format code with 'styler'.
    The interface uses accessible language for beginners and supports both
    Portuguese and English.
